WEBVTT

00:00:05.159 --> 00:00:06.204
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:00:06.247 --> 00:00:07.431
PO: Gotcha.
抓住你了

00:00:08.815 --> 00:00:10.068
[KAI LAUGHING]

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.602
I see you.
我看到你了

00:00:14.777 --> 00:00:17.389
Your chi will soon be mine.
你的气马上就是我的了

00:00:17.432 --> 00:00:18.607
Is he talking to me? Which one?
他在跟我说话吗 哪个 他们都在说话

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.000
They're all talking.
他在跟我说话吗 哪个 他们都在说话

00:00:20.044 --> 00:00:22.004
Whoa, you're right.
That's so scary.
哇 你说得对 好恐怖啊

00:00:22.008 --> 00:00:24.483
We should try that, too.
Maybe it'd be scary back at them.
说不定能吓唬吓唬他们

00:00:24.526 --> 00:00:26.104
Okay, but we gotta plan
what we're gonna say first.
行 可是我们得先商量好怎么说

00:00:26.127 --> 00:00:27.834
Otherwise, it won't be scary.
It'll just be stupid.
否则不但不吓人 还会被当成傻帽

00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:30.315
It's not them talking,
you idiots!
这群白痴 不是他们在说话

00:00:30.358 --> 00:00:31.866
It's me talking
through them. Kai!
是我天煞在借助他们说话

00:00:31.925 --> 00:00:33.231
ALL: Who?
谁 谁

00:00:33.274 --> 00:00:34.971
Okay, okay, okay.
Enough.
好啦好啦 够了

00:00:36.321 --> 00:00:37.452
[ALL GASPING]
哇

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.197
Did you see that? What just happened?
这什么情况呀 他们就这样

00:00:43.241 --> 00:00:45.286
The green smoke,
just poof! And then poof!
化作一缕青烟 嗖 就没了

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.027
Shifu, what was that?
师父 这什么玩意

00:00:47.071 --> 00:00:50.378
Kai... Kai... Kai...
天煞 天煞

00:00:50.422 --> 00:00:51.844
Nope, never heard of him.
没听说过

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.516
SHIFU: Kai... Kai...
天煞 天煞 在哪儿啊

00:00:54.589 --> 00:00:55.660
Where is it?
天煞 天煞 在哪儿啊

00:00:55.733 --> 00:00:57.960
There's so much wisdom in here,
I can't find anything.
这么多卷轴得找哪辈子去 哦 有了

00:00:58.163 --> 00:00:59.177
Yes!
这么多卷轴得找哪辈子去 哦 有了

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.650
Behold.
看吧

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.385
All the answers
will be found within.
所有的答案都在这里

00:01:07.656 --> 00:01:09.808
What? It's blank?
什么 一片空白

00:01:10.746 --> 00:01:13.227
Are you kidding me?
Not again.
耍我吗 又来这套

00:01:13.271 --> 00:01:14.381
[ALL GROANING]
耍我吗 又来这套

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.970
Wait, wait, hold on.
Sorry.
等等 等等 稍等 抱歉

00:01:17.014 --> 00:01:19.319
Oh, okay. Here we go.
哦 好吧 找到了

00:01:20.191 --> 00:01:22.976
It is written
in Oogway's hand.
是乌龟的手迹

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.152
"Long ago,
I had a brother..."
很久以前 我有一个兄弟

00:01:25.196 --> 00:01:27.241
Oogway had a brother?
乌龟有个兄弟

00:01:27.285 --> 00:01:30.549
"in arms. In arms. "Sorry. He says,
"Brother-in-arms."
战友战友 他说的是兄弟般的战友

00:01:30.592 --> 00:01:32.274
Maybe you should just
unroll it all at once?
你一下全摊开不就完了嘛

00:01:34.057 --> 00:01:37.556
"I was an ambitious young warrior
leading a great army."
我曾是一个统帅千军

00:01:40.254 --> 00:01:42.776
OOGWAY: And fighting
by my side was Kai...
我与天煞并肩作战 情同手足

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:45.723
my closest friend.
我与天煞并肩作战 情同手足

00:01:48.871 --> 00:01:51.657
One day,
we were ambushed.
直到有一天 我们遭遇了埋伏

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.922
I was badly wounded.
我身负重伤

00:01:53.976 --> 00:01:58.263
My friend carried me for days,
looking for help...
天煞背着我日夜奔波 四处求医

00:01:59.056 --> 00:02:01.406
until we came
to a secret village...
我们终于来到了一座藏于高山的神秘村庄

00:02:01.449 --> 00:02:03.582
high in the mountains.
我们终于来到了一座藏于高山的神秘村庄

00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:06.411
An ancient
place of healing.
古老的疗伤圣地

00:02:06.454 --> 00:02:09.414
A village of pandas.
一个熊猫村

00:02:09.457 --> 00:02:11.198
[ALL GASPING] Pandas?
熊猫

00:02:11.242 --> 00:02:13.766
OOGWAY: Yes, pandas.
对 是熊猫

00:02:13.809 --> 00:02:17.248
Pandas who used
the power of chi to heal me.
熊猫用气功治好了我的伤

00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:18.423
[GASPS]
熊猫用气功治好了我的伤

00:02:21.165 --> 00:02:24.132
They taught me
how to give chi.
他们传授给了我气功

00:02:28.288 --> 00:02:33.382
Oh, but Kai wanted
the power all to himself.
但天煞却想把神功据为己有

00:02:34.077 --> 00:02:38.658
He saw that what could be
given could also be taken.
他发现气既能被给予 也能被夺走

00:02:42.316 --> 00:02:44.449
I had to stop him.
我必须阻止他

00:02:46.016 --> 00:02:47.756
[KAI YELLING]

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:52.109
Our battle
shook the earth...
我们打得地动山摇

00:02:52.152 --> 00:02:54.241
until, finally...
后来天煞终于被驱逐到了灵界

00:02:54.285 --> 00:02:57.940
I banished Kai
to the Spirit Realm.
后来天煞终于被驱逐到了灵界

00:02:57.984 --> 00:03:00.726
Should he ever return
to the mortal realm...
如果他重返凡界

00:03:00.769 --> 00:03:04.860
he can only be stopped
by a true master of chi.
只有真正的气功大师 才能够阻止他

00:03:04.904 --> 00:03:06.620
"True master of chi"?
真正的气功大师 就像你

00:03:06.624 --> 00:03:07.994
Like you!
真正的气功大师 就像你

00:03:08.038 --> 00:03:09.865
Me? I can barely
make a flower bloom.
我 我也就会发功开个小花

00:03:09.909 --> 00:03:12.536
I need at least
30 more years, and a cave.
我至少还得修炼三十年

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.082
VIPER: We need a chi master.
需要个气功大师

00:03:14.115 --> 00:03:15.741
SHIFU: He will
continue stealing
不收走所有大师的气 他是不会罢手的

00:03:15.784 --> 00:03:17.525
the chi of masters
until he has consumed it all.
不收走所有大师的气 他是不会罢手的

00:03:17.569 --> 00:03:19.092
VIPER: We have to think
of a way to stop him!
我们得想办法阻止他

00:03:19.136 --> 00:03:20.267
CRANE: He'll get more
and more powerful
每打败一位大师 他就会变得愈加强大

00:03:20.311 --> 00:03:22.139
with every master
he defeats.
每打败一位大师 他就会变得愈加强大

00:03:22.182 --> 00:03:23.314
TIGRESS: There is no choice.
We fight.
那就打到他罢手

00:03:23.357 --> 00:03:25.055
I can teach you, son.
我可以教你 儿子

00:03:25.098 --> 00:03:26.230
[GASPS]
我可以教你 儿子

00:03:26.273 --> 00:03:28.841
You can do this?
你 会气功

00:03:28.884 --> 00:03:32.453
Of course.
I'm a panda.
当然啦 我是熊猫啊

00:03:32.497 --> 00:03:34.801
That must be why
the universe sent you here!
宇宙一定就是为了这个才派你来的

00:03:35.587 --> 00:03:37.502
Okay, so what do I
have to do?
好吧 我该怎么做呀

00:03:37.545 --> 00:03:39.243
You have to come home
with me.
你应该跟我回家 啥

00:03:39.286 --> 00:03:40.548
What?
你应该跟我回家 啥

00:03:40.592 --> 00:03:42.028
To the secret village?
回神秘熊猫村

00:03:42.072 --> 00:03:43.395
Yes, son.
是的 儿子

00:03:43.438 --> 00:03:47.207
You must rediscover
what it is to be a panda.
你得重新领悟做一只熊猫的真谛

00:03:47.251 --> 00:03:49.166
You have to learn
to live like a panda,
你要学着像熊猫一样的生活

00:03:49.209 --> 00:03:50.744
sleep like a panda...
像熊猫一样的睡觉

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:53.037
eat like a panda.
像熊猫一样的吃饭

00:03:53.474 --> 00:03:56.042
Those 103 dumplings?
[SCOFFS]
那一百零三个包子

00:03:56.086 --> 00:03:58.436
I was just warming up.
只是我开胃菜而已

00:03:58.479 --> 00:04:00.296
I've always felt like
I wasn't eating up
我就一直觉得我在吃这方面

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.547
to my full potential.
还有潜力没开发出来

00:04:02.156 --> 00:04:04.572
No, you can't take Po
away from me. No, no.
你不许把我们家阿宝带走

00:04:04.616 --> 00:04:06.357
I want a second opinion.
你没戏 不能听你一面之词

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.858
Shifu, open another scroll
or something.
师父 再打开一个卷轴什么的

00:04:09.055 --> 00:04:10.404
I think he should go.
你应该回熊猫村

00:04:10.448 --> 00:04:12.189
Fine, a third opinion.
就没有人帮我说句话吗

00:04:12.232 --> 00:04:14.626
Monkey? Viper? Tigress?
金猴 灵蛇 娇虎

00:04:14.669 --> 00:04:17.672
Dad, you heard
what Shifu said Oogway said.
老爸 你也听见师父和乌龟的话了

00:04:17.716 --> 00:04:20.458
This guy can only be stopped
by a master of chi.
只有真正的气功大师 才能够阻止他

00:04:20.501 --> 00:04:23.535
And I can only master chi
by knowing who I really am.
我也只有找到自我 才能掌握气功

00:04:23.852 --> 00:04:25.854
Well, I'm a panda.
成为一只真正的熊猫

00:04:30.424 --> 00:04:32.624
I'll pack you a lunch
for the road.
我给你们带点包子路上吃

00:04:34.776 --> 00:04:36.822
[BOTH PANTING]

00:04:38.954 --> 00:04:41.957
Do you really think
Po can master chi in time?
您真的认为阿宝能一下子学会气功吗

00:04:42.001 --> 00:04:43.698
Doesn't matter
what I think.
我怎么认为不重要

00:04:43.742 --> 00:04:45.439
It only matters
what the universe thinks.
上天的旨意才重要

00:04:45.483 --> 00:04:47.789
So, that's a "no"?
那就是没戏了呗

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:49.617
Master, what are
we going to do?
师父 我们要怎么办

00:04:49.661 --> 00:04:51.706
You are going to find out
where Kai is.
你去查明天煞的下落

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.818
Follow the trail
of those jade creatures.
跟着翡翠僵尸 但不要和他们过招

00:04:53.868 --> 00:04:55.406
But do not engage...
跟着翡翠僵尸 但不要和他们过招

00:04:55.449 --> 00:04:58.670
for with every foe he faces,
Kai becomes stronger.
每经过一次较量 天煞就愈加强大

00:04:58.713 --> 00:05:01.063
Why me?
Is it because I asked?
为什么选我 是因为我多了句嘴吗

00:05:01.107 --> 00:05:03.615
No. It is because
you can fly. Go!
不 是因为你会飞 去吧

00:05:04.676 --> 00:05:06.417
Should have kept your beak shut.
[LAUGHS]
就应该闭上你的鸟嘴

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:07.809
SHIFU: And take Mantis.
再带上螳螂 是因为我

00:05:07.853 --> 00:05:08.984
Oh, man.
Is it because I...?
再带上螳螂 是因为我

00:05:09.028 --> 00:05:10.245
Yes. [CRANE LAUGHS]
也多了句嘴 没错

00:05:10.259 --> 00:05:11.493
[GROANS]

00:05:33.008 --> 00:05:35.707
[PANTING]

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:36.969
[STOMACH GRUMBLES]

00:05:37.012 --> 00:05:38.146
Oh! Lunch break.
吃东西吧

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:39.276
Oh.
吃东西吧

00:05:39.319 --> 00:05:40.929
You don't need
to ask me twice.
就等你这句话呢 嗷

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:42.583
[MR. PING GROANS] Dad?
就等你这句话呢 嗷

00:05:42.627 --> 00:05:44.594
Yes? Dad?
老爸 干嘛

00:05:44.625 --> 00:05:45.804
Yes?
老爸 干嘛

00:05:45.847 --> 00:05:47.240
What are you doing here?
你在这儿干嘛呢 你说我干嘛呢

00:05:47.284 --> 00:05:49.895
What am I doing?
Getting a backache.
你在这儿干嘛呢 你说我干嘛呢

00:05:49.938 --> 00:05:51.897
Did you have to step
on every rock?
你一定要踩着石头走路吗

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.812
No, I mean,
why are you here?
不是 我是问你跟来干嘛呀

00:05:53.855 --> 00:05:55.553
What was I supposed
to do, huh?
那我还能干嘛呀

00:05:55.596 --> 00:05:57.716
What if the pandas
don't have food you like?
万一熊猫村吃的不和你胃口可怎么办

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.644
You're never gonna be able
to save the world
到时候 那你饿着小肚肚

00:05:59.687 --> 00:06:01.689
on an empty stomach.
怎么去拯救世界呀

00:06:01.733 --> 00:06:03.996
I consider my presence
mission critical.
你说他能离得开我吗 你说呀

00:06:04.039 --> 00:06:05.678
Oh... Yes, about that...
哦 对了 说起这事

00:06:05.711 --> 00:06:09.915
We can't share the location of the village
with others. So...
我们不能告诉外人熊猫村在哪儿

00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:12.744
Well, you think I can't
keep a secret, huh?
呃 你嫌我嘴不严 是吗

00:06:12.787 --> 00:06:15.007
I raised Po for 20 years
告诉你 我养了阿宝二十多年

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.009
before I finally told him
he was adopted.
才告诉他 他不是我亲生的

00:06:17.052 --> 00:06:19.213
Seriously? Yeah.
真的吗

00:06:19.256 --> 00:06:22.014
Okay. I guess it would be
cruel to make you fly back.
好吧 让你飞回去的话也太残忍了

00:06:22.057 --> 00:06:23.124
[GASPS]
好吧 让你飞回去的话也太残忍了

00:06:23.798 --> 00:06:25.583
You can fly?
你会飞

00:06:25.626 --> 00:06:27.191
I'm a bird, Po.
鹅也是鸟啊

00:06:31.719 --> 00:06:33.678
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:06:40.293 --> 00:06:41.903
[BLOWING RASPBERRY] [GRUNTS]

00:06:43.818 --> 00:06:45.462
We're here.
我们到了

00:06:49.824 --> 00:06:52.000
Sure looks like a long
ways up there. [CHUCKLES]
你看这地儿有多高啊

00:06:52.697 --> 00:06:54.655
And my son hates stairs.
我儿子最烦爬台阶了

00:06:54.699 --> 00:06:56.396
So, let's go home.
走吧 咱们还是回家吧

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:59.138
We're pandas.
We don't do stairs.
我们可是熊猫啊 我们才不爬台阶呢

00:06:59.181 --> 00:07:00.951
I've waited my whole life
to hear those words.
我这辈子就等这句话呢

00:07:01.488 --> 00:07:02.902
[BELL DINGING]

00:07:04.752 --> 00:07:06.073
Rats.
扯淡

00:07:14.936 --> 00:07:17.251
Whoa... Huh?
哇喔

